# The Python test toolchain every sandboxed run sees, read-only. Installed into the
# sandbox image at build time; runs never install anything (they have no network).
# Libraries a typical service under test imports are included so its tests can run:
# FastAPI and Flask apps are exercised in process (TestClient, test_client), never over
# a network.
pytest
pytest-cov
coverage
fastapi
httpx
pydantic
flask
requests
